     "body": "<p>Half of this PR did not make it into the commit (because that half was included in an earlier commit to master: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1122\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1122</a>). However, that earlier commit to master did not get included in the 4.6.0-maintenance branch.</p>\n\n<p>PR for second half of PR-1124:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>for 4.6.0-maintenance: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1139\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1139</a></li>\n\t<li>for 4.6.1-RC: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1140\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1140</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
